Command                              | Use
-------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------
mkdir mern-project                   | Creates a folder named mern-project
cd mern-project                      | Moves inside the project folder

mkdir server                         | Creates backend folder
mkdir client                         | Creates frontend folder

npm init -y                          | Creates package.json with default values

npm install express                  | Installs Express.js for building APIs
npm install mongoose                 | Installs Mongoose for MongoDB connection
npm install cors                     | Allows frontend and backend communication
npm install dotenv                   | Loads environment variables from .env
npm install bcryptjs                 | Hashes passwords securely
npm install jsonwebtoken             | Creates and verifies JWT tokens
npm install multer                   | Handles file uploads

npm install -D nodemon               | Restarts server automatically on changes

npm create vite@latest client -- --template react
                                    | Creates a React project using Vite

cd client                            | Moves into React project folder

npm install                          | Installs all dependencies

npm install axios                    | Makes HTTP requests to backend APIs

npm install react-router-dom         | Enables routing in React

npm run dev                          | Starts development server

node server.js                       | Runs backend server

git init                             | Initializes a Git repository

git add .                            | Adds all files to Git staging

git commit -m "Initial Commit"       | Saves a Git snapshot
